            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#AA">
                <p>Lucius Minicius Exoratus, son of Lucius, of tribe Oufentina, flamen of divus Titus Augustus Vespasianus by consent of the decurions, military tribune
                   quattuorvir with aedilician power, duovir for administering justice, prefect of engineers from a praetor twice, and consular, pontifex, for himself,
                   and his wife, Geminia Prisca, daughter of Gaius, and Minicia Bisia, daughter of Lucius, he made [this] whilst living.
                </p>
